		-- (2026-11-04) E held in the air: prototype_air's grab bank (graph_air 2494-2503, graph_jump's the same on the upper body): input Action down, the slot empty: alex_climb_air 0-30
		-- cyclic, and the grab item for as long as it lasts, 1.2 m, 0.7 m ahead of Motion_Root (1 m over his feet), no change to the fall. BY EYE, asked for and not the game's: there this
		-- grab's give keeps only a helicopter (a jump's, a brawler too) and lets all else go; here a body is his, as the running grab takes one, and he falls on with it (fall/pose/holding/grapple)
		-- (2026-11-05, on for everyone. User: "надо захват в воздухе сделать, я вводил команды в консоль, все равно не работало": E was off, and with it on, dead just where the game takes a human)
		-- The air dash (2001-2003) and the flying kick's flight (928-941): execute 108, 1.4 m, the dash with no pose of its own, the kick's alex_kick_air_straight 20-37 for 0.1 s, then alex_climb_air.
